# Three concurrent task dispatches in one assistant turn: the subagents
# panel shows a row per dispatch (name column, running token counts, a
# "→ "/"✓ " action row per subagentRow) while all three are still in
# flight, per docs/kiln-design-handoff/Terminal.dc.html's agents block.
# design: Terminal.dc.html:374 (agents block: name/task/last action/bar/tokens)
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-task-concurrent.yaml
@fixture testdata/behaviour/qa/model-roles-fast-heavy
@args --permission-mode acceptEdits

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE scout the upload path with three subagents
KEY enter
WAITFOR /subagents running in parallel/ 20
SHOT three-live
EXPECT /3 subagents running in parallel/
EXPECT /check the auth middleware/
EXPECT /check the upload route/
EXPECT /check the redis mock/
WAITFOR /3 subagents finished/ 20
SHOT three-done
EXPECT /All three scouted/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
